Chapter: Asn1DerTest
  cites Encode chapter Asn1
  cites Foreword chapter Ed25519
  cites Foreword chapter Maybe

 The DER decoder, gated on the certificate the IETF published in RFC 8410
 section 10.2 and the Ed25519 public key it published in section 10.1.

